    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #331\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to branch `bb/relay-125-mcp-integration-04-07-synchronize-tool-thr_4925wmgiz3` (updated PR #331).\n\nThis push adds the code-review fixes on top of the earlier `#125` implementation:\n\n- **Pagination**: `syncMcpServerTools` now follows `tools/list`'s `nextCursor` across every page before validating/materializing anything, so a paginated response no longer causes tools on later pages to be wrongly deactivated as \"no longer advertised.\" Guarded against a server whose pagination never terminates.\n- **Error-recording safety**: a failure while writing `syncStatus: 'error'` after a sync failure is now logged and swallowed instead of replacing/hiding the original sync error — the caller always sees the real failure.\n- **Temp-file cleanup**: `startStdioContractServer`'s `stop()` now deletes its two temp files instead of leaking them into `os.tmpdir()` across test runs.\n\nVerified: full build, the full `mcpSync.test.ts` suite (24 tests, including 3 new pagination unit tests), and the full repository test suite (653 tests across unit/integration/e2e) plus the dependency-boundary check all pass.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
